# Keep text files LF in the working tree, matching the blobs GitHub Pages serves.
# The LIVE/TEST launchers patch game.html with multi-line string anchors that use
# \n; a CRLF worktree copy (core.autocrlf=true) never matches them, so serving a
# local checkout fails with "Corn collision test patch mismatch". See
# DEVELOPMENT.md 2026-11-01. Binaries are left alone by text=auto.
* text=auto eol=lf
